{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15880","headline":"送郑录事赴太原 · 张南史","name":"送郑录事赴太原","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"叹息不相见，红颜今白头。\n重爲西候别，方起北风愁。\n六月胡天冷，双城汾水流。\n卢谌即故吏，还复向幷州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张南史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15880.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15880","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}